---
// Area page 진행 순서: the owner swimlane diagram (client pick C, 2026-11-11).
import ProcessFlow from '../ProcessFlow.astro';
import type { ServicePage } from '../../data/service-pages';

interface Props { page: ServicePage }
const { page } = Astro.props;
const hasCustomerStep = page.process.some((s) => s.owner === 'customer');
---
<section class="section svc-process svc-process--lanes" aria-labelledby="process-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 id="process-title">진행 순서</h2>
      <p>왼쪽에서 오른쪽 순서로 진행합니다.{hasCustomerStep && ` 노란 줄이 고객님이 직접 하실 일입니다.`}</p>
    </div>
    <ProcessFlow steps={page.process} />
  </div>
</section>
